    border: {style: dash, width: 1.3, color: "$accent"}
  - elementId: rt-migrate-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [512, 316, 150, 30]
    content: {fontSize: 9.5, color: "$accent", lineHeight: 1.35, align: [left, top], text: 扩容时仅少量会话迁移（如 S4 → 实例 3）}

  - elementId: rt-right
    elementType: text
    bounds: [640, 140, 264, 230]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 12.5
      lineHeight: 1.6
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>· 根据 <strong>Session ID 一致性哈希</strong>到推理算子</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px">· 扩缩容时<strong>最小化会话迁移</strong></p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px">· 会话自动路由到其<strong>会话状态所在的新算子实例</strong></p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px">· 与点 3a 配合：路由目标即缓存所在位置，保证语义命中</p>

